{"1686230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mayday: The Survival Island", "steam_appid": 1686230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE DEMO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/0d7a32de16dcdd2aafd633c600f612f6.poster.avif?t=1787869471\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/0d7a32de16dcdd2aafd633c600f612f6.webm?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/0d7a32de16dcdd2aafd633c600f612f6.mp4?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/5bf64c7e47b49386f0802ac408afd439.poster.avif?t=1787869471\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/5bf64c7e47b49386f0802ac408afd439.webm?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/3a13c272e8da49f370239dbcc28ba39d.poster.avif?t=1787869471\" width=610 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/3a13c272e8da49f370239dbcc28ba39d.webm?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious crash, you awaken alone on a remote island—injured, disoriented, and surrounded by untamed wilderness. <i>Mayday: The Survival Island</i> is an open-world survival crafting game where your mission is to build, adapt, and uncover the truth behind your arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft tools, and shape your own survival strategy. Hunt wild animals, fish the shoreline, grow crops, and build a homestead to sustain yourself. As your base grows stronger, venture across a sprawling archipelago full of secrets waiting to be unearthed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/17df3da1b8814e5e3fc0be4d23336c68.avif?t=1787869471\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival and Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world made up of 24 unique islands—each with distinct environments, resources, and challenges. From misty swamps and sun-bleached beaches to ancient cemeteries and forgotten ruins, every biome offers new opportunities and hidden threats. Find treasure, upgrade your tools, and learn how to adapt to each island’s dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/dd31c67a1121034686a38ddc38200c8d.poster.avif?t=1787869471\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/dd31c67a1121034686a38ddc38200c8d.webm?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/dd31c67a1121034686a38ddc38200c8d.mp4?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mystery Beneath the Surface</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just surviving—you’re being watched. Strange symbols, magical totems, and fragments of a lost civilization hint at a greater story hidden beneath the waves. The deeper you explore, the more you’ll question why you crashed here… and whether escape is even possible. Every action, from gathering food to defeating powerful guardians, may reveal new pieces of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/3918f1ba84f8247fb64a96e2d2173d09.poster.avif?t=1787869471\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/3918f1ba84f8247fb64a96e2d2173d09.webm?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/3918f1ba84f8247fb64a96e2d2173d09.mp4?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom-Driven Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no forced objectives or linear paths. You decide how and when the story unfolds. Spend hours building your ideal base, raise animals and tend crops, or set out across the islands in search of answers. Every gameplay system—from fishing to farming to combat—is woven into your journey and rewarded with meaningful discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/c994519d36d4b745ca69751f28caf151.poster.avif?t=1787869471\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/c994519d36d4b745ca69751f28caf151.webm?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/c994519d36d4b745ca69751f28caf151.mp4?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Customize, and Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is your lifeline—and your legacy. Gather materials to craft tools, construct shelters, and expand your homestead into a thriving hub. Raise animals, set up farms, and unlock new crafting stations that open up advanced survival options. As your island life becomes more stable, you’ll gain access to new areas, new upgrades, and deeper insights into the world around you. Every structure you build brings you one step closer to mastering the island—or escaping it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/86ce2e8ee065258b64c943bc55d40f58.poster.avif?t=1787869471\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/86ce2e8ee065258b64c943bc55d40f58.webm?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/86ce2e8ee065258b64c943bc55d40f58.mp4?t=1787869471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌊 Survival is just the beginning. The island has plans of its own.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686230/extras/5bf64c7e47b49386f0802